meta {
  name: Scrape Dividends from PSE EDGE
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/dividends/scrape
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Scrape Dividends from PSE EDGE

  Scrapes all dividend records from the PSE EDGE dividends calendar at
  `https://edge.pse.com.ph/disclosureData/dividends_and_rights_info_list.ax`
  and stores them in the local SQLite database.

  The scraper:
  1. Fetches the first page to determine total page count
  2. Iterates through all pages (with 300ms delay between requests)
  3. Parses each HTML table row into a dividend record
  4. Saves all records to the local `dividend` table (INSERT OR REPLACE)

  Returns the full scraped dividend calendar as JSON.

  Also supports `POST` (equivalent behavior).

  **Note**: This may take several seconds depending on the number of pages
  (currently ~11 pages, ~540 records).
}
